---
---

<section class="features" id="processo">
  <div class="features-header">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow orange" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Nosso processo</p>
      <h2 class="features-title">Como a <em>serigrafia</em> transforma sua sacola.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="features-desc">Dois processos que garantem resultado profissional, do primeiro ao último item da tiragem.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-card-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <span class="feature-step">Passo 01 — Preparação</span>
      <h3 class="feature-h">Separação de cores com precisão cirúrgica</h3>
      <p class="feature-p">Cada cor da sua arte recebe uma tela exclusiva, gravada e posicionada com registro milimétrico. Bordas nítidas, cores vivas — em toda a tiragem, sem variação.</p>
      <div class="feature-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="200" height="80" viewBox="0 0 200 80">
          <rect x="20" y="10" width="160" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#0d0d0d" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <rect x="20" y="31" width="160" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#e05c2a" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <rect x="20" y="52" width="160" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#0d0d0d" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,3"/>
          <text x="100" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="8" letter-spacing="3" fill="#0d0d0d">COR 01</text>
          <text x="100" y="43" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="8" letter-spacing="3" fill="#e05c2a">COR 02</text>
          <text x="100" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="8" letter-spacing="3" fill="#9b8f7a">COR 03</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-card-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <span class="feature-step">Passo 02 — Finalização</span>
      <h3 class="feature-h">Tinta fixada para durar tanto quanto a sua marca</h3>
      <p class="feature-p">Usamos tintas à base de plastisol e água, curadas em alta temperatura. Sem rachaduras, sem desbotamento — mesmo após uso intenso e lavagens frequentes.</p>
      <div class="feature-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="200" height="80" viewBox="0 0 200 80">
          <path d="M20 60 Q60 20 100 40 Q140 60 180 20" fill="none" stroke="#e05c2a" stroke-width="2"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="60" r="4" fill="#e05c2a"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="40" r="4" fill="#e05c2a"/>
          <circle cx="180" cy="20" r="4" fill="#e05c2a"/>
          <text x="20" y="74" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="7" letter-spacing="1" fill="#9b8f7a">APLICAÇÃO</text>
          <text x="80" y="74" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="7" letter-spacing="1" fill="#9b8f7a">CURA 180°C</text>
          <text x="158" y="74" font-family="Special Elite" font-size="7" letter-spacing="1" fill="#9b8f7a">PRONTO</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.features {
  background: var(--warm-white);
  padding: 100px 64px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--light);
}
.features-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
  gap: 40px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.features-title {
  font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-size: 52px;
  max-width: 480px;
}
.features-title em {
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--orange);
}
.features-desc {
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--mid);
  max-width: 320px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.features-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 2px;
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
}
.feature-card {
  padding: 52px 48px;
  background: var(--warm-white);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20px;
  border-right: 2px solid var(--ink);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: background .2s;
}
.feature-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
.feature-card:hover { background: var(--paper); }
.feature-card-num {
  font-size: 100px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--orange);
  opacity: .12;
  position: absolute;
  top: 16px;
  right: 24px;
  font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;
  pointer-events: none;
  user-select: none;
}
.feature-step {
  font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  color: var(--orange);
}
.feature-h {
  font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-size: 34px;
}
.feature-p {
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--mid);
  line-height: 1.55;
  max-width: 380px;
}
.feature-diagram {
  height: 160px;
  margin-top: 16px;
  border: 2px dashed var(--light);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.feature-diagram svg { opacity: .35; }

@media (max-width: 639px) {
  .features { padding: 60px 24px; }
  .features-header { flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 36px; gap: 16px; }
  .features-title { font-size: 28px; }
  .features-desc { max-width: 100%; }
  .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .feature-card { padding: 36px 28px; border-right: none !important; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .feature-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .feature-h { font-size: 22px; }
  .feature-p { font-size: 17px; }
  .feature-card-num { font-size: 72px; }
}

@media (min-width: 640px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
  .features { padding: 72px 36px; }
  .features-title { font-size: 36px; }
  .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .feature-card { padding: 40px 32px; }
  .feature-h { font-size: 24px; }
}

@media (min-width: 1280px) {
  .features-title { font-size: 56px; }
}
</style>
